  "description": "<p>If you have acl:Write or acl:Append permissions you should be able to perform certain PATCH requests. But if you send your request with a Content-type with a character set.</p>\n\n<p>ie. Content-type: application/sparql; charset=ISO-8859-1</p>\n\n<p>It will fail.</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>&gt; curl -i -utestuser:testpass <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/BOX\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/BOX</a> -XPATCH -H\"Content-type: application/sparql-update\" -d\"PREFIX dc: &lt;<a href=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/</a>&gt; INSERT {&lt;&gt; dc:description \\\"This is awesome\\\" } WHERE {}\" <br/>\n <tt>HTTP/1.1 204 No Content</tt><br/>\n <tt>Date: Tue, 18 Sep 2018 13:51:12 GMT</tt><br/>\n <tt>Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID=9zlq6vhpild61wll4nnbt1io9;Path=/</tt><br/>\n <tt>Expires: Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT</tt><br/>\n <tt>Set-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/; Max-Age=0; Expires=Mon, 17-Sep-2018 13:51:12 GMT</tt><br/>\n <tt>ETag: W/\"76f4fa22890d72190b83a44607125b1a1cb0b44a\"</tt><br/>\n <tt>Last-Modified: Tue, 18 Sep 2018 13:51:12 GMT</tt><br/>\n <tt>Server: Jetty(9.3.1.v20150714)</tt></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p><tt>&gt; curl -i -utestuser:testpass <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/BOX\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/BOX</a> -XPATCH -H\"Content-type: application/sparql-update; charset=UTF-8\" -d\"PREFIX dc: &lt;<a href=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/</a>&gt; INSERT {&lt;&gt; dc:description \\\"This is awesome\\\" } WHERE {}\"</tt><br/>\n <tt>HTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden</tt><br/>\n <tt>Date: Tue, 18 Sep 2018 14:09:14 GMT</tt><br/>\n <tt>Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID=1xhuf7y4mmkl31k3t91gtbcilj;Path=/</tt><br/>\n <tt>Set-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/; Max-Age=0; Expires=Mon, 17-Sep-2018 14:09: